## Scientific citation

Quanty is developed as scientific research software. If Quanty contributes to scientific work, we ask that the appropriate Quanty publications be cited.

A current list of recommended publications can be found at:

https://www.quanty.org/

and can also be obtained by running Quanty.

For users choosing the CC BY 4.0 license, citation of the appropriate Quanty scientific publications is the requested form of attribution.

For users choosing the MIT License, scientific citation is strongly encouraged as normal academic practice, but is not an additional condition of the MIT License.

